From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wangzlei <66336933+wangzlei@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 13:23:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] pin-to-cwagent: align go.mod with amazon-cloudwatch-agent
 v1.300074.0

Generated by scripts/pin-to-cwagent.sh: go 1.25.8; every module OBI requires
that cwagent also selects is set to cwagent's version where OBI's was higher
(collector v1.56.0/v0.150.0, otel v1.44.0, otel exporters v1.43.0, grpc
v1.82.1, prometheus client_golang v1.23.2, k8s v0.35.3, aws-sdk-go-v2
v1.41.12, golang.org/x/arch v0.8.0, proto/otlp v1.10.0, ...); OBI-only
collector modules put on the same train; contrib detectors pinned to the
newest release not exceeding cwagent's lines; OBI-only indirect deps re-resolved
by go mod tidy. Only github.com/cilium/ebpf stays above cwagent's (graph-only)
v0.17.3: OBI's loader and bpf2go bindings need v0.22.0.

Code adaptations forced by the downgrade:
- go.opentelemetry.io/ebpf-profiler dropped. Every release fitting collector
  <= v1.56.0 (<= v0.0.202614) lacks the processcontext package and still
  needs golang.org/x/arch >= v0.23.0 / mdlayher/socket v0.5.1. Vendored
  verbatim from v0.0.202633 instead: processcontext.go ->
  pkg/internal/processcontext, libpf.Address/PID + pfunsafe + remotememory ->
  pkg/internal/processcontext/pf.
- go.opentelemetry.io/proto/otlp/processcontext/v1development dropped (all
  releases need proto/otlp >= v1.11.0, which would bump cwagent's proto/otlp,
  grpc-gateway and genproto); its generated process_context.pb.go is vendored
  as pkg/internal/processcontext/processcontextpb (builds on otlp v1.10.0).
- github.com/containers/common dropped (all v0.6x releases need
  containerd/cgroups/v3 v3.0.5, cwagent has v3.0.3); its only use,
  cgroupv2.Enabled(), is replaced by the statfs check already in
  pkg/ebpf/cgroupv2.go.
- contrib detectors/azure/azurevm v0.17.0 -> v0.16.0 lacks
  NewResourceDetector/WithAttributeFilter; meta_node_azure_compat.go applies
  the same attribute filter to the detected resource.
- contrib detectors/aws/eks v1.45.0 -> v1.43.0 (v1.44.0 requires k8s
  client-go v0.35.4), detectors/gcp -> v1.43.0, detectors/aws/ec2/v2 -> v2.5.1.
- go-playground/validator v10.30.3 -> v10.20.0 has no built-in "oneofci"
  tag (v10.22.0+); validation panicked ("Undefined validation function
  'oneofci'") on every config. validator_compat.go registers an equivalent
  case-insensitive oneof as an OBI custom validation.

No OBI feature is disabled.

Adot-Obi-Patch: 99-pin-to-cwagent
